One Last Check: The Compiler
Since your Java code compiles this .jrxml file at runtime (every time you click the button), your project must include a Java Compiler.
If you are running this on a small JRE (Java Runtime Environment), the compilation will fail because javac is missing.
The Easy Fix: Add this dependency to your pom.xml. It adds the Eclipse Compiler for Java, which allows JasperReports to compile XML even without a full JDK installed.
<dependency>
    <groupId>org.eclipse.jdt</groupId>
    <artifactId>ecj</artifactId>
    <version>3.26.0</version> </dependency>

